 "notes": [
  "Gen 8 singles: Palkia's Copycat calls Mind Blown, which Charjabug's Damp stops (`cant|p1a: Charjabug|ability: Damp|Mind Blown|[of] p2a: Palkia`). The failed TryMove clears the called move's `mindBlownRecoil`, and `runMove`'s `AfterMove` runs on that move (`battle.activeMove`), so Palkia loses no HP. The engine waived the self damage in the called move's run but paid it in the action's, which asked its own flag (R-M11-125; probe131, m8-gen8-singles-s1946-000)"
